1831/002-233dbc0b74.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3771831/002-233dbc0b74.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n京都高岛屋的屋顶！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天真热！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n听说京都放晴后会超过29度！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在这么热、这么热的天气里，特地来参加抽奖的各位，谢谢大家！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n就算没抽中，也请来下午的签名会玩哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">来たよ！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3771831/001-3026f1eb3e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3771831/001-3026f1eb3e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n        このホウオウかっこいいよね！\n\n<br>\n\n\nコダックも！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n抽選会場は・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3771831/002-233dbc0b74.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3771831/002-233dbc0b74.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n京都高島屋さんの屋上！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今日は暑い！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n京都は晴れ29度超えるみたい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n暑い暑い中\n抽選に集まってくださった皆さん\nありがとうございます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nもし外れちゃっても\n午後のサイン会も\n遊びに来てね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}